XML Parser: the event-based xml_parser functions, on libxml2 of the
package az.

The module xml of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/xml.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/xml.
